Subject: Cantor EVO-X2 Remote Preflight Private Permit Bridge P0 Design

@ [design_uuid] 2dc1c5cb-cb35-4e88-bf36-a0d31460c84e
@ [source_uuid] a28dc152-1260-4cfa-a8e8-6379f087d7a1
@ [canonical_uuid] 06d82d16-143a-4abb-9c70-c03163285842
@ [predecessor_bookend] 40b20537cbe8fbd143bb3298ea92ca8b77f46c33

& [Architecture]
  + declare evox2_remote_preflight_private_permit_bridge as pub(crate) without a public glob export
  + place an opaque admission type and private bridge core in that module; reserve a later nested live_initiation child as the only eligible production construction locus
  + add one pub(crate) runner issuer that consumes the opaque admission and constructs the existing unchanged private-field permit
  + move the permit directly into the existing runner from a FnOnce private core and convert every post-issue result into terminal state

& [IndependentReceipt]
  + on runner success serialize through the published canonical serializer reparse through the published strict parser and validate the reparsed receipt again
  + compare canonical bytes and exact receipt digest before classifying available or provider-unavailable completion
  + on parse validation or identity refusal return receipt_refused without returning the run as accepted evidence

& [Reachability]
  + production has no admission constructor bridge export binary CLI environment trigger feature path or ambient dispatcher
  + child unit tests directly construct private values and use a private FnOnce mock; they do not call the production physical entry
  + a later live-initiation formation must add the nested constructor and independently prove operator identity custody trusted time consent revocation and replay control

& [FailureSemantics]
  + every pure validation failure occurs before issuance
  + after issuance the attempt is spent even when the runner returns before process creation or cannot provide a receipt
  + no error or terminal structure contains admission or permit and no path can rejoin the core

& [NonAuthority]
  + this design authorizes no admission construction permit construction before implementation publication runner invocation OpenSSH contact EVO-X2 observation provider request remote call effect or retry
